# Note: packages/fixtures/data/ IS tracked.
#
# The parser tests read recorded PSX responses and never touch the network, so
# the fixtures are test inputs, not build output. They must be versioned or a
# fresh clone has no working test suite.
#
# They are protected from publication by `"private": true` on the fixtures
# package, not by .gitignore. Do not add them here.
